# Keep transient Claude Code agent worktrees out of the Nx project graph.
# Each worktree under .claude/worktrees/ contains a full copy of the workspace;
# without this, Nx raises MultipleProjectsWithSameNameError while agents run.
.claude

# The design prototype is a standalone package with its own lockfile, not a workspace project.
# Its vite.config.ts needs dependencies the workspace install does not provide, so the Nx vite
# plugin must not load it.
design
